  aciklama: "4. kat, daire 4, bo\u015F ve elektriksiz (\u0131\u015F\u0131k ve karanl\u0131k).
    Oda B'nin \u015Fifresi salon duvar\u0131nda fosforlu boyayla: yaln\u0131zca kafa
    lambas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. Oda B'de Hasan'\u0131n alet kutusunda
    sigorta; tak\u0131l\u0131nca lambalar yanar ve buzdolab\u0131 a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r,
    i\xE7inde Hasan'\u0131n notu ve kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131. Banyo, kiler ve Oda
    A kapal\u0131. Oda oda d\xF6\u015Fendi (#83)."
